   Anyone have any other ways to get past "killer bones levels"?

You're not supposed to get past, you're supposed to GetARealLife(TM).

My favorite thing to do is to go down to level 4 in wizard mode, create a
room full of ancient dragons, and then suicide, leaving behind a bones
file.

When we had grenades, it was really easy to do this even as a non-wizard.
You just get 4 or 5 grenades and arm them one after another while standing
on the up staircase.  The first grenade will kill you, and the rest will
be left for the next person to come down the stairs.

